    {
      "id": "order-title",
      "name": "Title Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Handle Paid Order\n\nHandler for one store event: an order was paid (event 'order_paid'). It moves the customer to Purchased or Repeat Customer, records the order, and marks the matching checkout as converted so no reminder is sent.\n\n**Called by:** the main workflow '[GHL Store Automation] | WF1 - Store Events & Win-Back' (its 'Run ... Handler' node, chosen by 'Route By Event Type'), which passes the normalised event together with the store settings. **Standalone-capable:** no.\n\n**Sections on this canvas:**\n1. Sync The Paid Order\n\nGoHighLevel work is done by the GHL Adapter workflow (mock or live, chosen by 'ghl_adapter_id') and email by the Email Sender workflow (both called with Execute Workflow). Any failure is reported to the central error handler with THIS workflow's name and the failed node's name.",
        "width": 2200,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "order-sec",
      "name": "Section 1 Note - Sync The Paid Order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sync the paid order\n\nTriggered by: the main workflow's 'Run ... Handler' node, event 'order_paid'.\n\nWhat it does, step by step:\n1. Looks the customer up in ghl_store_customers.\n2. Decides first purchase or repeat purchase (an earlier order in the table, or Shopify's own order count for this customer).\n3. Moves the contact to Purchased or Repeat Customer, tags it 'customer', removes 'cart-open' and 'winback-active', records the order value. If this fails: 'Order Sync Failed P1'.\n4. Saves the customer's order count and last order date, and resets the win-back state.\n5. Marks the matching checkout as converted so no abandoned-cart reminder is sent.",
        "width": 2200,
        "height": 800,
        "color": 6
      }
    }
  ],
